'''Shistavanen''' were a [[species]] of [[Sentience|sentient]] [[Hair|fur]]-covered bipeds with [[wolf]]like faces,<ref name="Chewie 1" /> clawed paws, and glowing [[Color|yellow]]<ref name="SR" /> or red [[eye]]s.<ref name="Chewie 1" /> Their [[homeworld]] was the [[planet]] [[Uvena Prime]].<ref name="Forged in Battle" /> One Shistavanen was [[Odabba]], who worked for [[Garello Technologies]] during the [[High Republic Era]].<ref name="Light of the Jedi">''[[The High Republic: Light of the Jedi]]''</ref> According to a story, the red [[Star|sun]] rays that hit of the [[moon]] of [[Lupal]] turned the visiting Shistavanen explorer [[Kordus Vrak]] into a feral beast.<ref name="Blood Moon">{{StoryCite|story=Blood Moon|book=Dark Legends}}</ref> By the time of the [[New Republic Era|New Republic]], a Shistavanen known as [[Brutus]] sailed the stars as the [[First Mate]] of [[Jod Na Nawood|Mad Captain Silvo's]] [[Silvo's pirates|pirate crew]].<ref name="Real Adventure">{{SkeletonCrew|This Could Be a Real Adventure}}</ref>

